    {
      "id": "1324923084590809201",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-04T02:11:19.247+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "```Two months ago, the Lazarene Security Councillor Debussy was unveiled as a villain the region knew very well – Feux. Feux had gathered endorsements, influence, and political leverage in the region to further a plot to take over the democratic government. This was not the first time Feux targeted Lazarus, with four past instances of subversion and totalitarianism at his hands.\n\nOutside of his attempts in Lazarus, Feux built quite the reputation for himself in Europe, Osiris, and the New Pacific Order. His actions in NPO, alongside that of a few others, became part of the reason the New Pacific Order became targeted by anti-Pacifican forces, losing the region its good standing as well as its allies. For over a decade, Feux has haunted NS, and it is about time he is condemned by the WA. The East Pacific votes FOR this resolution.```",
      "author": {
        "id": "738186404399415336",
        "name": "theconstantofchange",
        "discriminator": "0000",
